    Text = "<PVPWeaponKeywords:Wheel of Destiny>: After equipping, the wielder's \"Strike,\" \"Skill,\" and \"Exalt\" descriptions become unidentifiable, but each instance of DMG, Shield, and healing is randomly increased by [Arg1]%~[Arg2]%."
