    Text = "\"What is your desire?\"\nMight, dominion, the restoration of the lost, a vengeance washed in blood...\nHe fell into a deep and gloomy silence, though the answer had long since resided in his heart—an unanswerable answer.\nHe wished for the sun to rise and set as usual. He wished for the world to simply go on as normal."
