    Text = "Consumes <DerivativeCardKeywords_153:\"Great Blade: Whalefall\"> to unleash. Gain [Power:Arg3] <PowerIconKeywords:STR>. Deals <Damage:[Damage:Arg1]> guaranteed Critical Hit DMG to the enemy with the highest DMG, which enjoys a [Arg2]% STR Bonus. For each +1 DMG <DerivativeCardKeywords_153:\"Great Blade: Whalefall\"> is causing the target to deal to you, \"Mundus Severance\" deals +[Arg4] DMG. <DerivativeCardKeywords_154:>"
