  Skill_4745_AwakerSkillBackgroundStory = {
    Text = [[
Two wills are constantly struggling within the mechanical body: one desires destruction, while the other refuses to yield. However, mere humans cannot prevail for long, and she will ultimately be devoured by the other, becoming a vessel of madness that exists solely for destruction.
