  Skill_70302_PropertyNameList = {
    Text = "$GrowValue1,CON*GrowValue2,$GrowValue3%,"
  },
  Skill_70303_AwakerSkillBackgroundStory = {
    Text = [[
If humanity is already on a one-way road to annihilation, is it an act of mercy to give them a little push?
Let the end come in an instant. Let pain crystallize. Let lovers cling to each other as oblivion takes them. 
If nothing hurts at the finale, could that, at last, be heaven?]]
  },
